---
description: When reporting CI status, use the format "✅/❌ build N — X passed / Y failed (Z flakes)" so it's scannable in chat.
---

Format CI status updates as one line:

```
✅ build 51 — 287 passed / 0 failed (0 flakes)
❌ build 52 — 280 passed / 5 failed (3 flakes, 2 real)
```

**Why:** Status is scanned, not read. A consistent format lets the team triage at
a glance and pipe these messages into other tools.

**How to apply:** When the user asks for "Jenkins status" or "CI status", reply
with the one-line summary first, then offer details on request.
